  - The change hooks into the existing per-input event OR at `hdl/top/protocol_processor_top.sv:3563` (`stri_events`).\n   - A started/stopped change that coincides with another GET_STREAM_INFO cause gives one coalesced notification carrying the final state. #181's queue coalescing applies.\n2. Add a suite case:\n   - START and STOP from controller A while A and B are registered: A and B are each notified once, with the state;\n   - a coincidence with a registration event: one notification;\n   - a planted mutant (the event not driven) that is KILLED.\n3. Update the docs that list the GET_STREAM_INFO notification causes (the AECP engine guide) and the notification campaign records.\n\nGates: every processor gate and campaign that builds a changed file, at base and head. The scratch-parent consumer gates use milan-fpga dev e26f1816 with three parent patches, the same as the #196 bank: evidence classification, milan_dp-67, and the #190 TSpec slot patch.\n\nSTOP on any top-level port, parameter or register-map change.\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/comments/6284522415/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/comments/6284530521","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/192#issuecomment-6284530521","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/192","id":6284530521,"node_id":"IC_kwDOT06kyc8AAAABdpZTWQ","user":{"login":"Mister-M-alt","id":161579364,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaGBZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161579364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt","html_url":"https://git